{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"barrow_knight","model_identifier":"barrow_knight","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# barrow_knight\n\nBarrow knight (C1), walker, 1.85 m = 66 u to the top of the great helm (crest to 70 u).\n\nA tall skeleton in a rusted mail hauberk with mail skirt and sleeves, a battered, rust-pitted great helm with a cracked crest and cold blue light in the eye slit, a kite shield with a faded chevron coat of arms and a notched longsword. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names plus `jaw`.\n\n- Cubes: 35 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -10.8..10.8, y 0.0..70.0, z -5.5..5.2 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 18 x 70 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.4 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.05 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.66 | loop |  |\n| `attack_slash` | 1 | once | key 0.5 s: wide arc from high right to low left (hits an arc in front, about 120 degrees, reach 40 u) |\n| `shield_up` | 1.6 | loop | held block against arrows (loop while held) |\n| `aggro` | 1.6 | once | bangs the sword on the shield twice |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch, shield arm thrown up |\n| `death` | 1.7 | hold | bones give way, folds back; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `burn` | 1.3 | loop | writhing in sunlight (loop) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 39.1 u/s (1.10 m/s), cycle 1.05 s, 41.1 u per cycle\n- `run`: 106.7 u/s (3.00 m/s), cycle 0.66 s, 70.4 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_slash`: key 0.5 s: wide arc from high right to low left (hits an arc in front, about 120 degrees, reach 40 u)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 67.25, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 46, 4.75)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2, 50.5, 4.75)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 56.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 44, -4.75)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (8.5, 30.75, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-11.25, 37.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-8.5, 30.75, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.25, 34, 1.75)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.25, 34, 1.75)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `longsword` (visible, under slot_hand_r): notched longsword, blade 33 u (93 cm), grip at the origin, blade along -Z\n- `kite_shield` (visible, under slot_shield_l): 13 x 25 u kite shield\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit eye-slit cubes.\n"},"description":"# barrow_knight\n\nBarrow knight (C1), walker, 1.85 m = 66 u to the top of the great helm (crest to 70 u).\n\nA tall skeleton in a rusted mail hauberk with mail skirt and sleeves, a battered, rust-pitted great helm with a cracked crest and cold blue light in the eye slit, a kite shield with a faded chevron coat of arms and a notched longsword. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names plus `jaw`.\n\n- Cubes: 35 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -10.8..10.8, y 0.0..70.0, z -5.5..5.2 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 18 x 70 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.4 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.05 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.66 | loop |  |\n| `attack_slash` | 1 | once | key 0.5 s: wide arc from high right to low left (hits an arc in front, about 120 degrees, reach 40 u) |\n| `shield_up` | 1.6 | loop | held block against arrows (loop while held) |\n| `aggro` | 1.6 | once | bangs the sword on the shield twice |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch, shield arm thrown up |\n| `death` | 1.7 | hold | bones give way, folds back; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `burn` | 1.3 | loop | writhing in sunlight (loop) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 39.1 u/s (1.10 m/s), cycle 1.05 s, 41.1 u per cycle\n- `run`: 106.7 u/s (3.00 m/s), cycle 0.66 s, 70.4 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_slash`: key 0.5 s: wide arc from high right to low left (hits an arc in front, about 120 degrees, reach 40 u)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 67.25, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 46, 4.75)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2, 50.5, 4.75)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 56.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 44, -4.75)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (8.5, 30.75, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-11.25, 37.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-8.5, 30.75, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.25, 34, 1.75)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.25, 34, 1.75)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `longsword` (visible, under slot_hand_r): notched longsword, blade 33 u (93 cm), grip at the origin, blade along -Z\n- `kite_shield` (visible, under slot_shield_l): 13 x 25 u kite shield\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit eye-slit cubes.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"neck","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.0,55.0,-1.0],"to":[1.0,57.5,1.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,55.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[104,66,106.0,68.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[106,66,108.0,68.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[108,66,110.0,68.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[110,66,112.0,68.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[52,69,54.0,71.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[54,69,56.0,71.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"a6db9adc-cbf9-599a-b99a-ec351701275b"},{"name":"arm_upper_r","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[7.25,42.5,-1.25],"to